  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Agent_hammer.jpg\" title=\"Agent Hammer in Disguise\"><img alt=\"Agent Hammer in Disguise\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"289\" src=\"/images/Agent_hammer.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Agent_hammer.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Agent Hammer in Disguise</div></div></div>\n<p>Agent Hammer, cleverly (?) disguised, is on Level 1 of Algernon.  The <a href=\"/wiki/Townston_Commander\" title=\"Townston Commander\">Townston Commander</a> gives a quest to speak with him, and then he gives quests too.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Agent_Hammer.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Agent Hammer's Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Fizz_Water_Burn\" title=\"Fizz Water Burn\">Fizz Water Burn</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
